### NainProspect - REST API Requests
@host = http://localhost:8000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### 1. Health Check
GET {{host}}/health HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 2. System Configuration
GET {{api}}/config HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 3. List Extracted Leads
GET {{api}}/pipeline/leads HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Trigger Prospecting Pipeline Run
POST {{api}}/pipeline/run HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "target_sector": "manufacturing",
  "max_leads": 10
}

### 5. Preview Compliance Outreach Template
POST {{api}}/templates/preview HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "company_name": "Acme S.L.",
  "recipient_email": "contacto@acme.com",
  "sector": "metal"
}
